Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:18.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑镜》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:29.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《人与武器的对抗》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 家伙们 起床 起床 司特普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, my people! Rise and shine. Get up, Stripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 睡醒了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You awake yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 清醒得一逼 - 步兵连\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure as shit ain't dreaming no more. - Company!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天 位于东边三英里的“情人瀑布”村\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something went down last night in Her Falls,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}a village about three miles east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.42,0:01:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接到报告 有座粮仓被闯入 洗劫一空\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got reports of a food store broken into, shit stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.14,0:01:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地人认为是蟑螂干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locals think it's roaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,蟑螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.07,0:01:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们五分钟后即将出发 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We head out in five minutes. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 看上去你是第一次执行现实的蟑螂剿灭任务 哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, so, it looks like you're getting your first real-live roach hunt, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.12,0:02:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 新来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, new!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.41,0:02:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,新来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}New!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫司特普\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Stripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.48,0:02:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你今天第一次直面蟑螂之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a little tip just in case you get your first toe-to-toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.57,0:02:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你一点小建议 - 哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- with one of them roaches today. - Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.39,0:02:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你看到一只出现在面前的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you see one right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要吓得屁滚尿流 那只会激怒它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}try not to shit your pants. It's only gonna piss them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我尽量 - 尽量无视伦恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll try. - Try to ignore Len.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的射击太烂 他是这世上唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}His aim's so bad, he's the only guy on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓到尿裤子还打不中的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who could shit his own pants and miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去你的 村姑 - 村姑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck you, farm girl. - Farm girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.69,0:02:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 狩猎融入了我的血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Hunting's in my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.58,0:02:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人是有天赋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us are naturals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.90,0:02:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.07,0:03:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂喂 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.14,0:03:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在可以说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can speak now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.69,0:03:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这一定是蟑螂干的 - 蟑螂 你亲眼所见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It must have been roaches. - Roaches, you see them? You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.54,0:03:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有亲眼看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.62,0:03:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过它们 一塌糊涂 一定是它们干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard them. All the mess. It must have been them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,来块曲奇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want a cookie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.32,0:03:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 它们在食物里待过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here you go. - They've been in the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会摧毁它们吃剩的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to destroy everything they left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.39,0:03:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些没人会吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以更换它们 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can replace that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们摧毁了冰箱 把它摧毁了还拿走了零件\N{\fnArial\fs30}They destroyed the cooler. Broke it and took the parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰箱 它们偷了冰箱的零件\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cooler? They stole parts from the cooler?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.34,0:03:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们往哪边跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在地上留下的脚印指出了方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were footprints in the dirt leading that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.37,0:03:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘·海德卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parn Heidekker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘·海德卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parn Heidekker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.02,0:04:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘·海德卡 是个人名吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heidekker? Is that a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.11,0:04:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让它们再来了 拜托 你必须阻止它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop them coming. Please, you must stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子被吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have child who is scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.94,0:04:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,司特普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stripe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这里的朋友认为蟑螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Our friend here thinks that the roaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.14,0:04:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,往一个叫潘·海德卡的家里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}went in the direction of Parn Heidekker's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个怪人 听上去像是个宗教怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local oddball, seems to be some kind of religious freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.27,0:04:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德森 海格 我需要你们留在这里帮助他们把食物烧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anderson, Hague, I want you to stay here and help them torch the food,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,安抚他们的情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep them calm and reassured.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的人 我们去探访海德卡家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of you, we're gonna drop in on Heidekker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,问些问题 搜查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask some questions, sniff around the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果看到蟑螂 我们要展示出有备而来 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's roaches, we show we're ready for them. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德卡先生似乎并不是所谓的社交名流\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Mr. Heidekker is not exactly what you call a socialite or a mingler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.54,0:05:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去他似乎有精神疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like mental health issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.06,0:05:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说他对于蟑螂他持有与众不同的观点\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got some interesting views on roaches, by all accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他的信息植入你们的主屏罩系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm putting his info in your Mass system now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个月前就有关于他的投诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been complaints lodged against him going months back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地人声称他让蟑螂肆意出没在他的地盘 并且留食物给它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locals claim that he let roaches cross his land, left food out for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.41,0:05:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过也许只是乡民的流言蜚语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be just shit talk from the local villagers though so…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.35,0:05:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多少蟑螂在外流窜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, how many roaches we got left out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.90,0:05:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,几千只 几百只\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of thousand? A couple of hundred, if that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.90,0:05:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说 过去有几百万只\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, back home we had millions, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们只用了两年时间就恢复到现在的数量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It only took two years to get shit back on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.51,0:05:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有乡巴佬丢东西给它们吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out here you got rustic fucks throwing them scraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪我们为什么要花那么多时间来善后了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder it's taken so long to mop shit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.13,0:05:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过为什么会有人蠢得要去帮助该死的蟑螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how can anyone be dumb enough to help a fucking roach?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.47,0:06:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,房子有前门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portals front and rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没开灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Windows blacked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,烟囱在冒烟 有人在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chimney smoke. Someone's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.01,0:06:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦纳德 你用炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lennard, you use the boomer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.83,0:06:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 屏罩系统确认 每个人都看到全景图了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Mass check. Everyone got the layout?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确认 - 确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.64,0:06:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.57,0:06:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾金 凡尔肯 寇奇 你们搜查外围建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aikin, Valcon, Coach, you check the outbuildings here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.74,0:06:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一间一间慢慢搜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them one at a time and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,司特普 莱曼 你们跟着我和伦纳德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stripe, Raiman, you come with me and Lennard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:06:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.37,0:07:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦纳德和我会和海德卡谈话 你们去搜剩下的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Len and I will talk to Heidekker, you check the rest of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的结果是一枪不发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Optimal outcome, no shots fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好面对蟑螂的准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except on a roach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好面对蟑螂的准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except on a roach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要翻译 我会你们的语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need for this. I speak your language.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.32,0:07:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想要什么 - 只是谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it you want? - Just to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.18,0:07:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经在谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,能好心地让我们进去谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a little more neighbourly if we did it inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜索二楼的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the upstairs rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 我不是你的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. I'm not your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.67,0:08:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are who?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 我们在那座村庄里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we got a whole bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.59,0:08:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一群害怕又生气的民众\N{\fnArial\fs30}of frightened, angry people in that village.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,蟑螂们闯入了粮仓 偷走了供给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roaches have been breaking into the food stores, stealing supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道些什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know anything about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是它们偷走的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, it's not just what they stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的所有食物都会被销毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that food left is gonna be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样让大家的日子更难过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes life harder for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.43,0:09:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过那边的围墙 你有你的准则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cross on the wall there. You got principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为所有的生命都是神圣的 这我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think all life is sacred. And I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意 所有的生命都是神圣的 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree. All life is sacred so…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.27,0:09:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至开始保护蟑螂 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you even got to protect the roaches. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的行为并不是他们的错 这一切不是他们想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not their fault they're like that. They didn't ask for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.95,0:09:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 我们都懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. We get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.60,0:09:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们血液里的东西使他们变成了这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's shit in their blood that made them that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.72,0:09:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们携带的病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sickness they're carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.38,0:09:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不关乎生命是否神圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't care about the sanctity of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.99,0:09:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是其他人是否要承受病痛的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the pain about who else is gonna suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不在五年 十年 二十年内阻止蟑螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't stop the roaches, in five, ten, 20 years from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.56,0:09:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍然会有孩子生出来就变成那样 然后它们会繁殖\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're still gonna get kids born that way, and then they're gonna breed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.99,0:10:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.19,0:10:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛苦的轮回继续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so it goes on. That cycle of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这些疾病本可以被避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sickness, and it could have been avoided.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,蟑螂窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking roach nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我检查这里 我去检查楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You check in there. I'll take the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.05,0:10:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天保护的每只蟑螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every roach you save today,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道明天会给多少人带去痛苦和绝望\N{\fnArial\fs30}you condemn God knows how many people to despair and misery tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.29,0:10:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能还将它们视为人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't still see them as human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.69,0:10:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实 你的情感值得被理解 但这是在误导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understandable sentiment, granted, but it's misguided.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.34,0:10:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果人类想继续生存 我们就得消灭他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta take them out if humankind is gonna carry on in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相就是这么残酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just the hard truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,总要有牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta make sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.84,0:11:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.77,0:14:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要听这个圣父一直叨叨回基地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta listen to Mr. Sunday School all the way back to base?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能捂住耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can cover your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.17,0:14:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 又或者 我能让他永远说不出话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, or, uh…I'll just hit permanent mute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下你的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,蟑螂爱好者也能杀的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roach lover counts as a kill too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个平民 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a civ, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.93,0:14:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你向平民开枪了 那你这辈子都得背负这件事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoot a civ, that's gonna stay with you the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟 司特普 你怎么这么认真呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Stripe, why don't you, uh…pull the stick out of your ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是逗他玩的 又不是逗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm fucking with him, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.74,0:14:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我猜你们两个都被我骗到了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I had you both going, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧掉这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's torch the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你还好吗 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you okay, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:14:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听说你刚刚杀了一只蟑螂 - 两只\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I heard you popped one in there. - Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 两只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, two?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.32,0:15:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我又杀了一只 用我的刀杀的 - 用刀杀的 天了噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got another one, with my knife. - With your knife? Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挺厉害的 是吧 - 是了 你这个该死的终结者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pretty good, right? - Yeah, you fucking Terminator.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,日了 第一次出任务 他杀了俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn! First time out, he gets two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个幸运的混蛋 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lucky motherfucker, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.98,0:15:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你这个混蛋今夜好梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dreams for this asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚能尝到甜头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna get a treat tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.46,0:16:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 射得好小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Miss Sharp Shooter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢人的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patronising fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷酷无情 你这个死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruthless! You're the Grim Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.66,0:17:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 下一次没有蟑螂能逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, no roach gets away next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.74,0:17:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是还在在意那事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still sweating that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.59,0:17:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从小就开始追捕鹿了 从不放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I grew up tracking deer.You never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.48,0:17:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢让它们跑掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like it when they get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.84,0:17:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.73,0:17:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是那些混蛋跑到森林里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, if that fucker made it to the forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.30,0:17:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许就能跑到边境那边 永远消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably made it to the border, gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.11,0:17:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说是没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's all right for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了两只\N{\fnArial\fs30}You popped two of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我已经很久没杀到蟑螂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的 我已经饥渴难耐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the gal is getting twitchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.23,0:17:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Rai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡得还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sleep good?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.23,0:18:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡得还行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I slept OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你就打算跟我说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, that's all you're gonna give me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.51,0:18:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 你知道吗 要是我一次杀了两只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? You know, if I got two in one go,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.62,0:18:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能会高潮一个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would want to come for like an hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.30,0:18:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! That's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.95,0:18:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你还好吗 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you okay, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.50,0:18:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我觉得我累了 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, think I'm tired is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 看来你昨晚的确过得挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so you did have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,39 40 41\N{\fnArial\fs30}39, 40, 41…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,42\N{\fnArial\fs30}42…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,43 44 43 46\N{\fnArial\fs30}43, 44, 45, 46,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,47 48 49\N{\fnArial\fs30}47, 48, 49,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.74,0:19:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,50 51 52\N{\fnArial\fs30}50, 51, 52,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.82,0:19:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,53 54 55\N{\fnArial\fs30}53, 54, 55,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.22,0:19:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,56 57 58 59\N{\fnArial\fs30}56, 57, 58, 59…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,强壮与纯洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong and pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,强壮与纯洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong and pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.63,0:19:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 司特普 你还好吗 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Stripe, you okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.42,0:19:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I… don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel a little off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我并没有生病什么的 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I ain't sick or nothing. It's just, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.85,0:19:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,去医务室报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report to the sick bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,诊断中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running diagnostic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个立方体\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cube.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.44,0:20:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正在旋转中吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rotating? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.59,0:20:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在呢 - 一棵树\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And now? - A tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 像是苹果树 - 点击树上的苹果\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like an apple tree. - Touch the apples for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,满分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.90,0:20:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说你头疼吗 - 是的 但是只是很快一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you say you had like a headache? - Yeah, but just quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.28,0:20:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么大不了的 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing big, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.89,0:20:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去你一切无恙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, everything looks okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.51,0:20:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何故障的迹象 你的植入体也没有任何问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of any malfunction or dropout with your Mass implant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.29,0:20:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后身体上 你好得不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And physically, you're in exemplary shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.69,0:21:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚经历过实战 你应该要预料到你会有点副作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've just seen combat, you can expect some sort of side effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么个 个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this, uh… this thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.94,0:21:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在农舍里 有光\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a light on it at the farmhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.16,0:21:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蟑螂手里的 - 蟑螂的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roach had it. - A roach had it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.52,0:21:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有点像手电筒 - 手电筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kind of like a flashlight. - Flashlight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.55,0:21:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.61,0:21:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,认真的 你没事 你的植入物没事 你的血液检测没事 一切都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, you're fine. Your Mass is fine. Blood's fine. It's all fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你该和奎特谈一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should speak to Arquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是奎特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Arquette?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.30,0:21:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你就是库南切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you must be Koinanchey?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.74,0:22:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,库南格 他们叫我司特普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koinange. Folks call me Stripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.27,0:22:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他们会这样叫你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they call you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.09,0:22:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他们也不能读出库南格的音吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't pronounce Koinange either, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.38,0:22:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那挺好笑的 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's funny. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.00,0:22:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍息 孩子 坐下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}At ease, son. Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.20,0:22:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你最近实施了你第一次杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you recently logged your first kills?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.07,0:22:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两只蟑螂 - 嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two roaches? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.38,0:22:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次出任务 可真不容小觑\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time out. It's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.27,0:22:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.32,0:22:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 杀蟑螂吗 - 嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, with the kills? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.38,0:22:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我当时在一个农舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. I'm in this, uh… farmhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.80,0:22:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有个 像是密室这样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this, like, hidden room or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.11,0:22:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走进去然后他们就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go in and there they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.10,0:22:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个 我就 是本能反应吧 直接开枪了 你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}First one, I just… It was automatic. Just pop-pop, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.47,0:22:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就像训练里的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Just like in training.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:22:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就是那样 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just like that, yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.94,0:23:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后第二个呢 - 他当时和我一起在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the second? - I mean, he was on the ground with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.10,0:23:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个公的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a he.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.70,0:23:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.36,0:23:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以那算是近距离交锋了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this was close quarters then?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.39,0:23:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他压在我身上 挣扎着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's on top of me. Struggling, I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.94,0:23:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿不到我的枪 所以我只能用刺他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't reach my rifle so I had to stick him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.20,0:23:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是刺它 用我的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick it. With my knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后那让你是什么感受呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how did that… feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.46,0:23:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 像是怎么 - 情感上是什么感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, like…? - Emotionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没什么感觉 我是说 太快了 那是自卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't. I mean, it was quick. It was self-protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.79,0:23:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我能感觉到的只有 松了一口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess all I felt was, you know, relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.06,0:23:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只有松了一口气吗 - 嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just relief? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.21,0:23:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过对你来说没有别的感觉也并不算少见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not unusual to experience other feelings too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.70,0:23:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至会有一瞬间的兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}A moment of euphoria even.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.42,0:23:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.06,0:24:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我觉得也许我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I thought maybe I'd feel…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.93,0:24:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别的什么感觉吗 - 对 就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something else? - Yeah, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.88,0:24:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,后悔 这样的感觉 但是就是没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regret. Something like that, but that just wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.86,0:24:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以再给你一次机会你还是会那样做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you'd do it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.56,0:24:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.96,0:24:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你为什么会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.98,0:24:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.71,0:24:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有过奇怪的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a few weird moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.79,0:24:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的屏罩系统看起来好像有故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Mass looked like it was glitching out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.94,0:24:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你的植入物 我是说 它们通过了每项诊断\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your implants, I mean, they passed every diagnostic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.04,0:24:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有任何问题吗 - 是啊 他们说没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There is nothing wrong with that? - Yeah, they said it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.55,0:24:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我觉得我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I think I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.20,0:24:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉有点什么不对劲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felt like something was up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.31,0:24:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是没有什么不对劲的地方 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But there's not. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.87,0:24:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了件大事 你该为自己感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did a big thing. You should be proud of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.43,0:25:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.15,0:25:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,会过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.76,0:25:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚让你好好睡一觉 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you a good sleep tonight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.24,0:25:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的酣眠\N{\fnArial\fs30}A real good sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.75,0:25:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,干我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.19,0:28:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,差得远呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way to go, fuck fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.50,0:28:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎我们对海德卡进行审问之后他并没有沉默多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems Heidekker didn't stay silent too long once we got to work on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.44,0:28:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他交待了一个地点 蟑螂们曾经在那里觅食\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's given up a location, someplace the roaches have been scavenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.40,0:28:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.50,0:28:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是间从战争开始之后就闲置的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a housing project that's been empty since the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.65,0:28:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这里不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.93,0:28:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制台希望我们在回基地之前去侦查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So control wants us to do recon before we go back to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.39,0:28:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能快点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we hurry it up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.69,0:29:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该烧毁整个森林的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ought to burn the whole forest down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.02,0:29:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那些蟑螂无处可逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give those roaches nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.82,0:29:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你看见那处了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.08,0:29:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳能电池板看着比其他的干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solar panel looks cleaner than the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.26,0:29:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有些电缆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there are some cables.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.09,0:29:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肯定是蟑螂们在获取电能呢 - 为什么是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's got to be roaches leaching power. - Why here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.18,0:29:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝才知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.90,0:29:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.84,0:29:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好打电话问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better dial it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.78,0:30:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制台 我是梅迪纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control. This is Medina.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.89,0:30:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有效账号 在这间房子附近发现了生物活动迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Positive ID. Signs of activity here at the housing project location.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.66,0:30:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见了一块太阳能电池板 看着最近被擦干净过 还有一些电缆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sighted one solar panel, looks recently wiped clean and some cabling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.06,0:30:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.42,0:30:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你那边还好吗 - 闻闻草地\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right there? - Smell the grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.86,0:30:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一般什么也闻不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't usually smell nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.22,0:30:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你曾经注意过吗 - 没有 我从没注意过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ever noticed that? - No, I never noticed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.79,0:30:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求行动方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Requesting course of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.82,0:30:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,未能读取 请重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't read. Please repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.17,0:30:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.06,0:30:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制台说我们应该后退 并且等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control says we should fall back and await comm…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.05,0:30:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.53,0:30:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅迪纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medina.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.88,0:31:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.09,0:31:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅迪纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medina.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.67,0:31:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,司特普 退后 她死了 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stripe, get back! She's dead. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.70,0:31:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 准备好了吗 掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Ready? Cover me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.54,0:31:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉伊 拉伊 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rai! Rai, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.48,0:31:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.40,0:31:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死的蟑螂搞了柄来复枪 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fucking roach got a rifle. Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.06,0:31:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,草 他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck. Piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.10,0:31:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 司特普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Stripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.33,0:31:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,司特普 快 聚在一起 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stripe, come on. Get it together, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.29,0:31:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开了六枪 他的来复枪看起来是老式的手动枪机\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fired six shots. His rifle looks old, bolt action.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.66,0:31:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上膛需要十秒钟 - 我们进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should take him ten seconds to reload. - We go in?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.94,0:31:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进去 然后把他弄出来 你跟我一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go in and take him out. Are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.94,0:31:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟你一起 - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm with you. - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.97,0:32:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.66,0:32:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 好的 三 二 一 掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready? Okay, three, two, one. Cover me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.57,0:32:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 哥们 什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man! What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.62,0:33:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is this shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.57,0:33:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.78,0:33:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,司特普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stripe!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.20,0:33:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 喔 没事的 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa! It's okay. Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.28,0:33:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 冷静 冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down. Calm down. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.25,0:33:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 没事 我不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay. I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.34,0:33:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hurt you. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.25,0:33:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续 从这里出去 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, get out of here. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.08,0:33:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不安全 有蟑螂在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not safe. There's roaches here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.02,0:34:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续 拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. Get.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.44,0:34:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.62,0:34:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莱 你干了什么 - 闭嘴 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rai, what did you do? - Shut up! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.08,0:34:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干了什么 莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do, Rai?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.70,0:34:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.40,0:35:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rai!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.55,0:36:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.33,0:36:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跑 - 你他妈干什么呢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run! - What the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.65,0:36:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在杀他们 - 他们是蟑螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're killing them! - They're roaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.02,0:36:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他么正在杀他们呢 莱 去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fucking killing them, Rai! Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.23,0:36:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑子出什么问题了 哥们 进屎了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck's wrong with you, man? You got some blown shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.49,0:36:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 齐心协力啊 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pull it together! - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.78,0:36:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.78,0:36:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得离开这里 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta get out of here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.66,0:36:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.92,0:37:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.29,0:37:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好跑快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better run.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.94,0:38:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.26,0:40:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.49,0:40:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.14,0:40:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看到我本来的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see me as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.93,0:40:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然能看见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.89,0:41:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有看见蟑螂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't see roach?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.33,0:41:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是蟑螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't a roach.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.74,0:41:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,蟑螂全都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roaches is all…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.62,0:41:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,乱七八糟的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.29,0:41:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,蟑螂不会说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roaches don't speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.18,0:41:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是听不到我们说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just can't hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.01,0:41:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你他妈说什么呢 - 你的植入物 你的军用植入物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the fuck are you talking about? - Your implants. Your army implants.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.14,0:41:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏罩系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mass system?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.22,0:41:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把它放入你的脑中 帮助你战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They put it in your head to help you fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.75,0:41:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当它发挥作用时 你会把我们看成别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when it works, you see us as something other.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.05,0:41:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之中的一个 卢卡 之前在做一种 一种机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of us, Luka, was making a… a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.96,0:41:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,光线 据说它可以干扰植入物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light flashes. Said it can interfere with the implant.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.37,0:41:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是蟑螂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're roaches?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.65,0:41:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我见过蟑螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've seen roaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.58,0:42:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过他们 他们都他妈的 像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen them, they're fucking… They're like, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.47,0:42:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 动物吗 - 不是 他们是怪兽 我见过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Animals? - No, they're monsters. I've seen them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.01,0:42:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,植入物让你看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The implant made you see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.97,0:42:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,操 那些村民 呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck. The villagers… Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.57,0:42:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,土著们 他们 他们不是军人 他们脑子里没有集体屏罩系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}The locals, they… they ain't army. They got no Mass in their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.44,0:42:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们害怕蟑螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're scared of the roaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.66,0:42:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们恨这东西 - 每个人都恨我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They hate the fucking things. - Everybody hates us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.83,0:43:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看见的是什么 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what the fuck do they see? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.79,0:43:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些该死的市民们 当他们看见蟑螂的时候 他们看见的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fucking civs, when they look at a roach, what do they see?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.11,0:43:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你现在见到的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.70,0:43:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还是恨 因为他们就是这样被教导的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hate all the same because it's what they've been told.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.81,0:43:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,十年前 开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten years ago, it began.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.90,0:43:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,战后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Post-war.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.78,0:43:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 筛查计划 检查DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, the screening programme, the DNA checks,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.15,0:43:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着登记 紧急措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the register, the emergency measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.54,0:43:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,而很快 每个人开始管我们叫怪物 肮脏的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And soon everyone calls us creatures. Filthy creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.22,0:44:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,每种声音 电视 电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every voice. The TV. The computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.53,0:44:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我们有 我们体内有疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say we have… we have sickness in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.22,0:44:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有弱点 在我们的血液里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have weakness. It's in our blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.91,0:44:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说我们的血液不能传承下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say that our blood cannot go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.14,0:44:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们不能存活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we cannot go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.96,0:44:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字曾是卡塔里娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name was Catarina.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.94,0:44:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的曾是亚历克\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was Alec.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.43,0:44:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们只是蟑螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're just roach.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.22,0:45:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.92,0:45:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你看到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.78,0:45:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你看到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.14,0:45:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rai?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.15,0:45:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rai, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.06,0:46:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我我不该杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me I shouldn't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.03,0:46:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切都不是真的 莱 - 你中什么邪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- None of it's true, Rai. - What the fuck got you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.37,0:46:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.10,0:46:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.14,0:46:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 背对着墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up. Back against the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.40,0:46:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.50,0:46:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我进到里面去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to come in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.80,0:46:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 我跟他聊聊就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. I can just talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.50,0:46:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 布里利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Briley.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.75,0:46:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,司特普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.51,0:46:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们欠你个道歉 我们没能在你的屏罩系统里发现错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}We owe you an apology. We didn't spot the fault in your Mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.96,0:47:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你带了杯咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you a coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.72,0:47:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在农场发现的设备 和医生说的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The device you found in the farmhouse, you mentioned it to the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.16,0:47:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this the thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.78,0:47:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在你和莱搜查过的旧街区里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found it on an old block that you and Raiman were searching.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.86,0:47:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是他们用我们的设备零件进行了反工程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they reverse engineered it from some of our drone parts and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.71,0:47:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面的光可以传送代码 就像病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The light here transmits a code. It's like a virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.74,0:47:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会融入你的屏罩系统 并从内部关闭它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It burrows into your Mass, trying to shut it down from within.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.55,0:48:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说 那些蟑螂变得比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, those roaches are getting more ingenious.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.94,0:48:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想象得聪明得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}than we give them credit for.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.76,0:48:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,整件事就是一个骗局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole thing is a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.55,0:48:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你为什么那么说 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand why you'd say that, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.69,0:48:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,蟑螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.46,0:48:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看起来和我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.94,0:48:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.68,0:48:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他们如此危险的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they're so dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.99,0:48:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类啊 你知道 我们不得不做这些坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans. You know, we give ourselves a bad rap,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.78,0:48:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但作为同一个物种却又真心地同情彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're genuinely empathetic as a species.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.47,0:48:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们并不想互相杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we don't actually really want to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.16,0:48:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.10,0:48:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你的未来要建立在清除敌人的基础上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until your future depends on wiping out the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.20,0:48:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.44,0:49:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在学校里学了多少历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how much history you studied in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.70,0:49:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多年前 我是说20世纪初\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many years ago, I'm talking early 20th century,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.10,0:49:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,多数士兵甚至不开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}most soldiers didn't even fire their weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.58,0:49:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者他们朝着敌人头顶放空枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or if they did, they would just aim over the heads of the enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.98,0:49:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did it on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.96,0:49:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次世界大战中的英军\N{\fnArial\fs30}British Army. World War I.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.98,0:49:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的陆军准将随军出征时 会拿一根棍子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brigadier, he'd walk the line with a stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.50,0:49:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,用痛打手下的方法命令他们开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he'd whack his men in order to get them to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.54,0:49:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是在第二次世界大战交火中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even in World War II, in a firefight,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.50,0:49:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也只有15%到20%的人或扣下扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}only 15%, 20% of the men would pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.74,0:49:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界的命运到了紧急关头 但是也只有15%的人开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fate of the world at stake and only 15% of them fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.06,0:49:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些说明了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what does that tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.29,0:49:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为这说明如果军方能力更全面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It tells me that that war would have been over a whole lot quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.95,0:49:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争可以尽快结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}had the military got its shit together.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.96,0:49:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以改变开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we adapted.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.79,0:49:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,加强训练 提高反应能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better training. Better conditioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.77,0:49:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在后来的越战中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then comes the Vietnam War,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.62,0:49:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火的概率提升到了85%\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the shooting percentage goes up to 85.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.69,0:50:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹横飞 但是死伤率还是很低\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of bullets flying. The kills were still low.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.28,0:50:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些击毙敌人的士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus the guys who did get a kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.57,0:50:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来之后 大多数人的精神状态都出现了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, most of them came back all messed up in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.68,0:50:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到屏罩系统出现 事情才有所改观\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's pretty much how things stayed until Mass came along.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.99,0:50:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 屏罩系统 是终极的军事武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Mass… Well, that's the ultimate military weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.80,0:50:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可以改变你的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It helps you with your intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.25,0:50:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标命中率 通讯 反应能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your targeting. Your comms. Your conditioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.42,0:50:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,向可怕的怪物开枪要容易得多 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lot easier to pull the trigger when you're aiming at the bogeyman, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.34,0:50:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅是你的眼睛 你的其它感官也被它管理\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just your eyes, though. Takes care of your other senses, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.85,0:50:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听不到尖叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't hear the shrieks.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.62,0:50:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻不到血腥和便溺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't smell the blood and the shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.59,0:50:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.30,0:50:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们的DNA里有多少恶心的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea the amount of shit that's in their DNA?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.86,0:50:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,高患癌率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Higher rates of cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.27,0:51:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,肌肉萎缩症 多发性硬化症 SLS 智商低下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Muscular dystrophy. MS. SLS. Substandard IQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.54,0:51:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯罪倾向 性异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Criminal tendencies. Sexual deviances.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.62,0:51:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.02,0:51:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是检查结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}The screening shows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.64,0:51:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想下一代人是这样的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you want for the next generation?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.06,0:51:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别觉得你的工作很坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't feel bad about doing your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.68,0:51:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,村民们不会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}The villagers won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.92,0:51:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父母不会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}The folks back home won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.79,0:51:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们没有屏罩系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't have Mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.07,0:51:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏罩系统帮你完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mass lets you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.92,0:51:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.19,0:51:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在保护血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're protecting the bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.79,0:51:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那 我的朋友 是个荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that, my friend, is an honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.58,0:51:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屁荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no honour here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.81,0:51:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.90,0:51:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谎言和杀戮 - 没人跟你说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lying and killing. - No one lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.30,0:51:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道一切 自始至终\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew all of this. All along.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.10,0:52:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.58,0:52:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自己同意植入屏罩系统的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You agreed to have your Mass implant put in.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.19,0:52:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且激活 每个军人都这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set up. Every soldier does.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.22,0:52:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能强行植入并且给你制造一个幻象 你的大脑会抗拒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just embed it and feed you a dream. Your mind would reject it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.74,0:52:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须接受 自愿地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to accept it. Willingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.67,0:52:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这样做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's exactly what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.82,0:52:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,条款和条件你都看了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you see the terms and conditions there?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.98,0:52:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 整个资料都看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's like a whole essay, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.84,0:52:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.42,0:52:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你同意植入屏罩系统时的录像 你六个月前签字的时候录的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your consent video. From when you signed up six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.14,0:52:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上 里面的内容就是 你同意激活你的屏罩系统移植物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, it says you agree to Mass implant activation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.98,0:52:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没做过这个 - 你做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't do this. - Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.37,0:52:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 功能就像是催眠 - 嗯 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Works kind of like hypnosis. - Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.74,0:52:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将不会想起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of what you're agreeing to is not realising.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.01,0:52:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,被调来这个州\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been put in this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.53,0:52:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来 你甚至会忘掉这次谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you follow me. You won't recall this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.92,0:52:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来挺滑稽 哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kind of funny, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.98,0:52:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.58,0:52:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为了表示同意 - 关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So for you to register consent… - Turn it off, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.87,0:52:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你点那里录下指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need your thumbprint there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.86,0:53:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这儿吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right here? - Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.50,0:53:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很屌哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's dope.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.89,0:53:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.67,0:53:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不记得了 - 跟那个人说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't remember that! - Just like the man said.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.94,0:53:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你不高兴 - 滚你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know you're upset. - Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.03,0:53:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 我们可以控制你看到的东西 司特普\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happening? - We control what you see, Stripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.71,0:53:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我什么也看不见 - 因为我们控制了你的视力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't see nothing. - Because we control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.83,0:53:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的还我眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me my fucking eyes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.39,0:53:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我给你几个选择 - 他妈的还我眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me lay out your options. - Give me my fucking eyes back, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.55,0:53:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我给你几个选择吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me lay out your options!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.78,0:53:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择一 你同意重置你的屏罩系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Option one, you agree to have your Mass reset.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.29,0:54:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去几天的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the recollections of the past few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.50,0:54:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括今天的谈话都会被清除\N{\fnArial\fs30}including this conversation, erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.59,0:54:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.77,0:54:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择二 监禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Option two's incarceration.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.15,0:54:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我建议你慎重考虑 - 滚你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd advise you to consider. - Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.83,0:54:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏罩系统是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mass is a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.90,0:54:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有它 你会记得所有你做过的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without it, you will remember everything that you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.30,0:54:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要这狗屁玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't having this Mass shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.92,0:54:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.94,0:54:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.62,0:54:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.42,0:54:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你该看看没有它 生活是什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should see what life would be like without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.31,0:54:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.72,0:54:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.86,0:54:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德卡牧场 三天前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heidekker's ranch. Three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.74,0:54:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都记录下来了 司特普 我们可以让你看你做的所有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have it all logged, Stripe. We can feed you everything that you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.86,0:55:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no, no, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.52,0:55:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 别开枪 别 求你了 别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Please don't shoot. Please! Please! Please don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.29,0:55:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你了 求你了 - 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please! Please! - No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.42,0:55:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Make it stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.06,0:55:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.04,0:55:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.06,0:55:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.54,0:55:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.13,0:55:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.22,0:55:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我擦 停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck off! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.68,0:55:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.99,0:56:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以看见 闻见 感觉到所有事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see and smell and feel it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.30,0:56:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你想要的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.42,0:56:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,反复循环 孤单地待在一个牢房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a loop? In a cell all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.42,0:56:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以抹去那段记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make that go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.60,0:56:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,也抹去这次谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}This conversation goes away too.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.94,0:56:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有都抹去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.67,0:56:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你必须得说那个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you gotta say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.39,0:56:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出那个词 司特普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just say the word, Stripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.06,0:56:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样一切就会消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it all goes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.98,0:56:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,说那个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just say the word.
